<title>PHILIPPINES: Rizal says to pay stock div March 5.</title>
<headline>Rizal says to pay stock div March 5.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rizal Commercial Banking Corp said on Friday its 6.50 percent stock dividend will be payable on March 5.</p>
<p>In a disclosure to the Philippine Stock Exchange, the bank said the dividend will cover stockholders on record as of February 5.</p>
<p>The bank set the ex-dividend date on January 27.</p>
</text>
